From: Shahriar Iravanian <siravan@svtsim.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 13:16:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] rusticol: pacman recurrence runner evaluates the source
 rows (local, e2e)

When the runner library reports the capability (pacman_recurrence_v1_capabilities bit 0)
and every source row is of the plain source executor with a supported family, the rows are
encoded as op 12 words (template code from pacman_source_template, masses as extra scale
slots) and their currents are no longer filled on the CPU and uploaded.
PACMAN_RECURRENCE_GPU_SOURCES=0 keeps them on the CPU.
